<title>GERMANY: German BHW names DMG, Dresdner, CSFB coordinators.</title>
<headline>German BHW names DMG, Dresdner, CSFB coordinators.</headline>
<dateline>HAMELIN, Germany 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>BHW Holding AG said on Friday Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, Dresdner Kleinwort Benson, and Credit Suisse First Boston would manage its stock market listing, planned for next year.</p>
<p>Aside from the three &quot;joint global coordinators&quot;, BHW said DG Bank, Norddeutsche Landesbank and Salomon Brothers would also be in the bank consortium underwriting the issue.</p>
<p>BHW, a building society for civil servants, recently reached a cross-shareholding agreement with Deutsche Postbank AG Hameln, with each taking a stake of at least 10 percent in the other.</p>
<p>-- Terence Gallagher, Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
